{
  "category": "Disaster Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Every time ABSOL appears before people, it is followed by a disaster such as an earthquake or a tidal wave. As a result, it came to be known as the disaster POKéMON.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "ABSOL has the ability to foretell the coming of natural disasters. It lives in a harsh, rugged mountain environment. This POKéMON very rarely ventures down from the mountains.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It sharply senses even subtle changes in the sky and the land to predict natural disasters. It is a long-lived POKéMON that has a life-span of 100 years.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom-bringer.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom-bringer.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has the ability to foretell natural disasters. Its life span is over a hundred years.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has the ability to foretell natural disasters. Its life span is over a hundred years.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "It appears from deep in the mountains to warn people about upcoming disasters it has sensed with its horn.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It appears from deep in the mountains to warn people about upcoming disasters it has sensed with its horn.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom bringer.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Every time Absol appears before people, it is followed by a disaster such as an earthquake or a tidal wave. As a result, it came to be known as the disaster Pokémon.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Absol has the ability to foretell the coming of natural disasters. It lives in a harsh, rugged mountain environment. This Pokémon very rarely ventures down from the mountains.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Long ago, superstitions were spread about it, saying it brought disaster. This fed a hatred of it, and it was driven deep into the mountains.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although it’s said to bring disaster, in actuality, this Pokémon possesses a calm disposition and warns people of any crises that loom.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "The only thing unlucky about Absol is its appearance. It protects fields and warns people of disaster, so one ought to be grateful for it.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "The elderly call it the disaster Pokémon and detest it, but interest in its power to predict disasters is on the rise.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Swift as the wind, Absol races through fields and mountains. Its curved, bow-like horn is acutely sensitive to the warning signs of natural disasters.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because of this Pokémon’s ability to detect danger, people mistook Absol as a bringer of doom.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
